1
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:03,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

2
00:01:30,380 --> 00:01:32,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[wind howling]</b></font>

3
00:01:33,590 --> 00:01:36,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Looks like it keeps
going forever from up here.</b></font>

4
00:01:36,390 --> 00:01:38,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't even see
all the way to the bottom.</b></font>

5
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
It's a 3,000-meter drop.</b></font>

6
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:44,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the deepest canyon
on the entire continent.</b></font>

7
00:01:45,020 --> 00:01:46,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The climb may have felt slow,</b></font>

8
00:01:46,940 --> 00:01:49,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but the elevation here
is immense.</b></font>

9
00:01:49,110 --> 00:01:50,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've been here before.</b></font>

10
00:01:50,610 --> 00:01:52,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So how do we cross it?
-[wind gushes]</b></font>

11
00:01:54,530 --> 00:01:56,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] The wind is quite strong.</b></font>

12
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:58,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Flying magic is too risky.</b></font>

13
00:01:58,990 --> 00:02:03,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Again with the crossing.
Again with the wind.</b></font>

14
00:02:03,790 --> 00:02:06,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] If we head upstream,
we could cross at the river.</b></font>

15
00:02:06,790 --> 00:02:08,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But we would
have to forge through</b></font>

16
00:02:08,710 --> 00:02:10,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a treacherous mountain range.</b></font>

17
00:02:10,670 --> 00:02:12,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A lengthy and dangerous detour.</b></font>

18
00:02:13,130 --> 00:02:15,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We could go downstream,
couldn't we?</b></font>

19
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Only one problem seaside.</b></font>

20
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:19,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a cliff that's also
3,000 meters.</b></font>

21
00:02:20,350 --> 00:02:22,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Apparently,
it's a sight to behold</b></font>

22
00:02:22,230 --> 00:02:23,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you'd like to drop by.</b></font>

23
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:24,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] No, thank you.</b></font>

24
00:02:24,690 --> 00:02:26,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Either way, at this rate,</b></font>

25
00:02:26,650 --> 00:02:28,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's going to take us
a bare minimum of two weeks</b></font>

26
00:02:28,980 --> 00:02:30,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to safely cross the canyon.</b></font>

27
00:02:30,690 --> 00:02:32,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My feet can't take it.</b></font>

28
00:02:32,990 --> 00:02:34,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not like we have
any other choice, right?</b></font>

29
00:02:35,610 --> 00:02:36,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Hmm...</b></font>

30
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:39,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I imagine
it's in the final stages.</b></font>

31
00:02:39,870 --> 00:02:42,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's in the final stages?</b></font>

32
00:02:42,830 --> 00:02:44,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For now,
let us continue upstream.</b></font>

33
00:02:45,580 --> 00:02:48,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we're lucky, we'll come upon
a nifty shortcut.</b></font>

34
00:02:48,590 --> 00:02:50,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

35
00:02:55,300 --> 00:02:56,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our shortcut.</b></font>

36
00:02:57,010 --> 00:02:58,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] I had a good feeling.</b></font>

37
00:02:58,640 --> 00:02:59,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] There's a bridge?</b></font>

38
00:02:59,970 --> 00:03:02,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should've led with that.</b></font>

39
00:03:02,810 --> 00:03:05,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] At last,
looks like he's finished it.</b></font>

40
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:07,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

41
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:08,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Gehen.</b></font>

42
00:03:08,810 --> 00:03:10,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] It's been
a while, Frieren.</b></font>

43
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:13,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Seems your
bridge project was a success.</b></font>

44
00:03:13,990 --> 00:03:15,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[GEHEN] Indeed.
-[FERN] You know him?</b></font>

45
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:18,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] This is Gehen,
the skilled dwarven carpenter</b></font>

46
00:03:18,530 --> 00:03:21,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who spent the past two centuries
building this bridge.</b></font>

47
00:03:21,450 --> 00:03:22,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] So dedicated.</b></font>

48
00:03:22,830 --> 00:03:25,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm surprised
to see it finished.</b></font>

49
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:27,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A bridge this well-made
should be a major crossing,</b></font>

50
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:30,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>yet I haven't heard it mentioned
or recorded on any maps.</b></font>

51
00:03:31,210 --> 00:03:34,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I assumed that meant
it was still in progress.</b></font>

52
00:03:34,260 --> 00:03:37,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And perhaps we would find you
in the last stretch.</b></font>

53
00:03:37,130 --> 00:03:38,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] Frieren...</b></font>

54
00:03:38,510 --> 00:03:41,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there is still one more problem
for me to solve.</b></font>

55
00:03:41,180 --> 00:03:42,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[loud whooshing]</b></font>

56
00:03:45,140 --> 00:03:47,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[wind gushes]</b></font>

57
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] Right on cue.</b></font>

58
00:03:53,030 --> 00:03:55,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A flock of bird monsters
have been stirring up</b></font>

59
00:03:55,490 --> 00:03:56,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>powerful gusts of wind.</b></font>

60
00:03:56,780 --> 00:03:58,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Some merchants came through</b></font>

61
00:03:58,160 --> 00:04:00,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on their journey
to the so-called Golden Land.</b></font>

62
00:04:00,660 --> 00:04:03,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They were blown over
the side, wagon and all.</b></font>

63
00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:04,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can slay them,</b></font>

64
00:04:04,870 --> 00:04:06,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-but they'll only keep coming.
-[wings flapping]</b></font>

65
00:04:06,910 --> 00:04:08,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They've built a nest</b></font>

66
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:10,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and made this canyon
their playground.</b></font>

67
00:04:10,380 --> 00:04:14,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In doing so, they've rendered
my bridge useless.</b></font>

68
00:04:14,670 --> 00:04:18,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fortunately, the nest is located
on this side.</b></font>

69
00:04:19,340 --> 00:04:21,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Could you help me
solve my problem?</b></font>

70
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:25,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't let 200 years
of work go to waste.</b></font>

71
00:04:26,020 --> 00:04:27,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As for payment?</b></font>

72
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:31,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] A spell that lets you
flip pancakes perfectly.</b></font>

73
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have all the ingredients.</b></font>

74
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:36,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A breakfast of dreams
is just one chore away.</b></font>

75
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Fern gasps]
-[STARK] Uh...</b></font>

76
00:04:38,110 --> 00:04:39,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-You have a deal.
-[Fern grunts]</b></font>

77
00:04:39,990 --> 00:04:41,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

78
00:04:47,830 --> 00:04:49,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[wind howling]</b></font>

79
00:04:49,290 --> 00:04:51,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>According to Gehen,
we should be drawing near.</b></font>

80
00:04:51,670 --> 00:04:54,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] That path is
awfully close to the edge.</b></font>

81
00:04:54,750 --> 00:04:56,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Watch where you step.</b></font>

82
00:04:56,420 --> 00:04:58,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your bodies would be
impossible to find.</b></font>

83
00:04:58,550 --> 00:05:00,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

84
00:05:11,850 --> 00:05:13,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why did Gehen
take it upon himself</b></font>

85
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:16,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to build a bridge here
in the first place?</b></font>

86
00:05:18,110 --> 00:05:20,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sure regret had
something to do with it.</b></font>

87
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:22,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] I see.</b></font>

88
00:05:22,610 --> 00:05:24,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, it's still
under construction.</b></font>

89
00:05:24,570 --> 00:05:25,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's a shame.</b></font>

90
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:28,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you know
when it will be finished?</b></font>

91
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] I'm not sure
it will ever be.</b></font>

92
00:05:31,460 --> 00:05:33,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I ran out of funds.</b></font>

93
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:36,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Doesn't that sting?</b></font>

94
00:05:37,250 --> 00:05:40,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All the time in the world
and none of the money.</b></font>

95
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:42,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell us, Gehen,</b></font>

96
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:45,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why are you so determined
to build a bridge out here?</b></font>

97
00:05:46,010 --> 00:05:47,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] In a happier time,</b></font>

98
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:49,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this is where my village sat.</b></font>

99
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Still would if it weren't
for the demons.</b></font>

100
00:05:52,690 --> 00:05:54,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unfortunately for us,</b></font>

101
00:05:54,230 --> 00:05:58,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the closest army was stationed
in a city across the canyon.</b></font>

102
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:02,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This bridge
could've saved them,</b></font>

103
00:06:02,150 --> 00:06:03,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but too little, too late.</b></font>

104
00:06:03,570 --> 00:06:05,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Should've thought
to build it sooner.</b></font>

105
00:06:07,990 --> 00:06:09,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

106
00:06:09,410 --> 00:06:10,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL]
Perhaps this can help.</b></font>

107
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:13,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our reward
from a distant noble.</b></font>

108
00:06:13,410 --> 00:06:16,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Demons stole a treasured sword
and my party helped reclaim it.</b></font>

109
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:19,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] This is a lot of money.</b></font>

110
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:23,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you,
but I can't accept this.</b></font>

111
00:06:23,260 --> 00:06:26,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have nothing suitable
to offer you in exchange.</b></font>

112
00:06:28,260 --> 00:06:29,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] You have this bridge.</b></font>

113
00:06:29,930 --> 00:06:32,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] Huh? You're a human.</b></font>

114
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>By the time
I finish construction,</b></font>

115
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:36,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll have died of old age.</b></font>

116
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Himmel chuckles softly]</b></font>

117
00:06:38,900 --> 00:06:41,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] Then Frieren
will accept your repayment.</b></font>

118
00:06:41,530 --> 00:06:42,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren gasps softly]</b></font>

119
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:45,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Give her at least
a thousand years.</b></font>

120
00:06:45,490 --> 00:06:47,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Build it to last.</b></font>

121
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:50,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] That I can do.</b></font>

122
00:06:50,620 --> 00:06:52,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can count on me.</b></font>

123
00:06:52,290 --> 00:06:53,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

124
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:49,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Here they are.
Let's begin.</b></font>

125
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:52,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whooshing]</b></font>

126
00:07:56,730 --> 00:07:58,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunting]</b></font>

127
00:07:58,980 --> 00:08:00,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

128
00:08:15,490 --> 00:08:16,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Gehen...</b></font>

129
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:19,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We took care of the monsters.</b></font>

130
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:21,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] Thank you, Frieren.</b></font>

131
00:08:21,380 --> 00:08:24,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now folks can freely
cross the canyon.</b></font>

132
00:08:24,250 --> 00:08:26,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My work here is done.</b></font>

133
00:08:26,420 --> 00:08:27,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What now?</b></font>

134
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you have any other
big projects ahead of you?</b></font>

135
00:08:30,090 --> 00:08:31,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] Hmm...</b></font>

136
00:08:32,550 --> 00:08:34,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm building my peace.</b></font>

137
00:08:34,510 --> 00:08:36,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A quiet life in my village.</b></font>

138
00:08:43,940 --> 00:08:45,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN 1]
Hey, look who's back.</b></font>

139
00:08:45,690 --> 00:08:47,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN 2]
And just in time for dinner.</b></font>

140
00:08:47,530 --> 00:08:50,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's amazing news, Gehen.
This calls for celebration.</b></font>

141
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:54,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[GEHEN] Frieren...</b></font>

142
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:56,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Two hundred years
is more than enough time</b></font>

143
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:59,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for a village to be built anew.</b></font>

144
00:09:00,290 --> 00:09:01,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course.</b></font>

145
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:03,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

146
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:11,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Well, shall we be off, then?</b></font>

147
00:09:24,980 --> 00:09:26,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern groaning]</b></font>

148
00:09:26,770 --> 00:09:28,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is something wrong?</b></font>

149
00:09:28,780 --> 00:09:31,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] We may or may not be
low on travel funds.</b></font>

150
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Ah!</b></font>

151
00:09:33,910 --> 00:09:36,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You didn't leave us with enough
to get through a single week.</b></font>

152
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:37,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren groans softly]</b></font>

153
00:09:38,330 --> 00:09:42,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs] Mistress, you can't
keep wasting all our money.</b></font>

154
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:44,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not like it matters now.</b></font>

155
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:47,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are we buying
in the middle of a snowfield?</b></font>

156
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:51,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm. Don't you worry.</b></font>

157
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:53,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have just the solution.</b></font>

158
00:09:55,850 --> 00:09:58,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
We're changing course.</b></font>

159
00:09:58,180 --> 00:10:00,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Prepare your pockets.</b></font>

160
00:10:03,850 --> 00:10:05,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What is this?</b></font>

161
00:10:05,270 --> 00:10:08,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Not a village,
that's for sure.</b></font>

162
00:10:08,070 --> 00:10:09,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe some adventurer camp?</b></font>

163
00:10:09,730 --> 00:10:12,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] All right, boys,
let's get out there</b></font>

164
00:10:12,070 --> 00:10:13,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and give it all we've got.</b></font>

165
00:10:13,650 --> 00:10:14,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ALL] Yeah!</b></font>

166
00:10:15,030 --> 00:10:17,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where have you taken us
this time?</b></font>

167
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:19,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Stark is correct that
it's a camp for adventurers.</b></font>

168
00:10:19,990 --> 00:10:22,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Those seeking
holy snow crystals.</b></font>

169
00:10:23,330 --> 00:10:25,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Am I supposed to know
what that is?</b></font>

170
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:26,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
It's a mineral</b></font>

171
00:10:26,830 --> 00:10:29,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>produced in the snowfields
of this region.</b></font>

172
00:10:29,710 --> 00:10:31,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're used to create
magic potions.</b></font>

173
00:10:32,010 --> 00:10:34,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the only place
in the world</b></font>

174
00:10:34,050 --> 00:10:36,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where they can be mined,
so they fetch a high price.</b></font>

175
00:10:36,930 --> 00:10:38,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I get what we're doing.</b></font>

176
00:10:38,310 --> 00:10:39,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now ready your pickaxes, ladies,</b></font>

177
00:10:39,890 --> 00:10:42,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>because these holy snow crystals
aren't gonna mine themselves!</b></font>

178
00:10:42,850 --> 00:10:45,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've seen so much
yet remain so naive.</b></font>

179
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Holy snow crystals</b></font>

180
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:49,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>aren't something you can
simply stumble upon.</b></font>

181
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:50,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why
they're so expensive.</b></font>

182
00:10:50,820 --> 00:10:53,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then how are we gonna
make any money here?</b></font>

183
00:10:53,900 --> 00:10:55,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have you ever been
to a marketplace</b></font>

184
00:10:55,570 --> 00:10:57,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that caters exclusively
to adventurers?</b></font>

185
00:10:58,370 --> 00:11:00,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll find it very interesting.</b></font>

186
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:07,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] It looks like your run
of the mill marketplace to me.</b></font>

187
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:10,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now look closer.</b></font>

188
00:11:11,550 --> 00:11:14,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A whole silver
for a loaf of bread?</b></font>

189
00:11:14,420 --> 00:11:16,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's more than ten times
the market price.</b></font>

190
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:19,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For their clientele is as rich
as they are hungry.</b></font>

191
00:11:20,010 --> 00:11:21,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mining is hard work,</b></font>

192
00:11:21,390 --> 00:11:23,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but their bounties are worth
their weight in gold.</b></font>

193
00:11:23,350 --> 00:11:26,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It only makes sense
prices are higher here.</b></font>

194
00:11:27,730 --> 00:11:29,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's change careers.</b></font>

195
00:11:29,940 --> 00:11:31,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There are two primary reasons</b></font>

196
00:11:31,900 --> 00:11:34,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>holy snow crystals sell
for such a high price.</b></font>

197
00:11:34,610 --> 00:11:36,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The first of which
is their rarity.</b></font>

198
00:11:36,860 --> 00:11:39,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The second reason
is that this region</b></font>

199
00:11:39,410 --> 00:11:41,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is teeming with savage monsters.</b></font>

200
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:45,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you see
where I'm going with this?</b></font>

201
00:11:45,370 --> 00:11:47,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Judging by what
they charge for bread,</b></font>

202
00:11:47,580 --> 00:11:51,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>monster slaying requests would
fetch a rather hefty reward.</b></font>

203
00:11:51,210 --> 00:11:53,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right as always, Fern.</b></font>

204
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:55,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[fire crackling]
-[MAN] Up here.</b></font>

205
00:11:55,420 --> 00:11:58,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a massive mineral vein
that only us locals know about.</b></font>

206
00:11:59,890 --> 00:12:02,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd like you to defeat
the monster dwelling there.</b></font>

207
00:12:03,140 --> 00:12:04,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One more thing.</b></font>

208
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:06,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once you've slain the beast,</b></font>

209
00:12:06,430 --> 00:12:08,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>please set up
an anti-personnel barrier.</b></font>

210
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:10,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anti-personnel?</b></font>

211
00:12:10,980 --> 00:12:13,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes. I don't want
the wrong people</b></font>

212
00:12:13,530 --> 00:12:14,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>getting too close.</b></font>

213
00:12:16,150 --> 00:12:18,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Understood. We'll take the job.</b></font>

214
00:12:18,860 --> 00:12:20,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
I'm grateful for the work,</b></font>

215
00:12:20,780 --> 00:12:22,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but an anti-personnel barrier</b></font>

216
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:25,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>feels like
a fairly unusual request.</b></font>

217
00:12:25,290 --> 00:12:27,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It takes time to gather
the manpower</b></font>

218
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:29,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and funds required
for a mining operation.</b></font>

219
00:12:29,330 --> 00:12:31,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you wish to claim
a plot of land</b></font>

220
00:12:31,330 --> 00:12:32,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but lack the resources to begin,</b></font>

221
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:35,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>an anti-personnel barrier
is your best option.</b></font>

222
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:37,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern sighs]</b></font>

223
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:40,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] In any case,
we have a monster to slay.</b></font>

224
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:42,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

225
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:58,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] There it is.</b></font>

226
00:12:58,900 --> 00:13:00,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That thing is giant.</b></font>

227
00:13:00,740 --> 00:13:02,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be sure to keep your guard up.</b></font>

228
00:13:02,660 --> 00:13:05,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We were hired for this job
as a last resort.</b></font>

229
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:06,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If the adventurers at camp</b></font>

230
00:13:06,370 --> 00:13:08,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>could've taken care of this,
they would have.</b></font>

231
00:13:08,710 --> 00:13:10,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Lack caution, and you'll die.</b></font>

232
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:14,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's only fair that the risk
matches the reward.</b></font>

233
00:13:15,300 --> 00:13:16,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's get to work.</b></font>

234
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:25,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[monster growls]</b></font>

235
00:13:25,890 --> 00:13:27,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[roaring]</b></font>

236
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:34,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts]</b></font>

237
00:13:38,490 --> 00:13:39,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark gasps]</b></font>

238
00:13:53,540 --> 00:13:56,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress, it's reacting
to our mana.</b></font>

239
00:13:56,210 --> 00:13:57,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What an annoying detail.</b></font>

240
00:13:57,500 --> 00:13:59,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunting]</b></font>

241
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:03,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
It's faster than it looks.</b></font>

242
00:14:07,260 --> 00:14:10,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Stark, run!</b></font>

243
00:14:10,350 --> 00:14:12,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's the first step of my plan.</b></font>

244
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That I can do!</b></font>

245
00:14:18,110 --> 00:14:19,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Higher.</b></font>

246
00:14:20,610 --> 00:14:22,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark pants, gasps]</b></font>

247
00:14:22,950 --> 00:14:25,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting, panting]</b></font>

248
00:14:27,070 --> 00:14:29,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

249
00:14:31,660 --> 00:14:33,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark yells]</b></font>

250
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

251
00:14:58,190 --> 00:14:59,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark pants, grunts]</b></font>

252
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:04,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark yells]</b></font>

253
00:15:25,260 --> 00:15:26,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark sighs]</b></font>

254
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:29,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] They made us
work for that reward.</b></font>

255
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both chuckle softly]</b></font>

256
00:15:34,640 --> 00:15:36,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Frieren?</b></font>

257
00:15:36,140 --> 00:15:37,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[FRIEREN] Quiet.
-[Fern gasps]</b></font>

258
00:15:37,900 --> 00:15:39,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growling]</b></font>

259
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:41,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Great. From bad to worse.</b></font>

260
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:43,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's safe to assume
our last opponent</b></font>

261
00:15:43,820 --> 00:15:45,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was the lord of this area.</b></font>

262
00:15:45,820 --> 00:15:48,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nearby monsters must have
sensed its mana fading</b></font>

263
00:15:48,530 --> 00:15:50,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and gathered here
to investigate.</b></font>

264
00:15:50,370 --> 00:15:52,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Any more plans, Frieren?</b></font>

265
00:15:52,410 --> 00:15:54,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have the energy
to carry you two and run</b></font>

266
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:55,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if we wanna go that route.</b></font>

267
00:15:55,830 --> 00:15:57,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Far too late for that.</b></font>

268
00:15:58,670 --> 00:16:00,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] We're surrounded.</b></font>

269
00:16:00,590 --> 00:16:03,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[growling]
-Indeed, but even if we weren't,</b></font>

270
00:16:03,090 --> 00:16:04,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we would still need
to slay them all</b></font>

271
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:06,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in order to complete the job.</b></font>

272
00:16:06,930 --> 00:16:09,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Think you have
enough mana, Fern?</b></font>

273
00:16:09,390 --> 00:16:11,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I should fare just fine.</b></font>

274
00:16:12,850 --> 00:16:14,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] We've no other choice.</b></font>

275
00:16:29,110 --> 00:16:31,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
The Chivalric Order of Norm.</b></font>

276
00:16:33,450 --> 00:16:35,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was clear
they were moving somewhere,</b></font>

277
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:37,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so we followed them
to find out where and why.</b></font>

278
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:40,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We weren't expecting
to find you three.</b></font>

279
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:42,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course not,
though we appreciate the help.</b></font>

280
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:45,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've done nothing
compared to you.</b></font>

281
00:16:45,090 --> 00:16:46,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Mm?</b></font>

282
00:16:46,510 --> 00:16:49,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Master Norm says
that we're in your debt.</b></font>

283
00:16:49,550 --> 00:16:51,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That you have done much
to help our cause.</b></font>

284
00:16:53,140 --> 00:16:55,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suppose this makes us even.</b></font>

285
00:16:55,350 --> 00:16:56,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[captain chuckles]</b></font>

286
00:16:59,310 --> 00:17:00,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CAPTAIN] Farewell.</b></font>

287
00:17:00,650 --> 00:17:02,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[hoofbeats receding]</b></font>

288
00:17:02,900 --> 00:17:06,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't believe they rode
all the way here. Impressive.</b></font>

289
00:17:06,650 --> 00:17:08,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Agreed. That squad is charged</b></font>

290
00:17:08,990 --> 00:17:11,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with watching over
their entire territory.</b></font>

291
00:17:14,450 --> 00:17:15,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if it's little by little,</b></font>

292
00:17:15,990 --> 00:17:18,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Northern Plateau
is changing.</b></font>

293
00:17:19,750 --> 00:17:22,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's long past sunset, huh?</b></font>

294
00:17:22,330 --> 00:17:24,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How about we set up
camp here tonight?</b></font>

295
00:17:26,630 --> 00:17:28,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[fire crackling]</b></font>

296
00:17:30,010 --> 00:17:31,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren groans softly]</b></font>

297
00:17:32,260 --> 00:17:35,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Frieren,
time to wake up.</b></font>

298
00:17:35,180 --> 00:17:36,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come see this.</b></font>

299
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:37,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren groans softly]</b></font>

300
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:40,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Just five more hours.</b></font>

301
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:41,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Fine,</b></font>

302
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-but you'll have to freeze.
-[groans]</b></font>

303
00:17:47,230 --> 00:17:49,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-It's worth waking up for.
-[Frieren groans]</b></font>

304
00:17:50,570 --> 00:17:52,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] The way the light
shimmers through the crystals...</b></font>

305
00:17:52,860 --> 00:17:55,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The vein is beautiful
in the morning sun.</b></font>

306
00:17:55,870 --> 00:17:57,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren gasps softly]</b></font>

307
00:17:57,990 --> 00:17:59,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] You're right.</b></font>

308
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:00,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

309
00:18:01,710 --> 00:18:04,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And to think
we only made a detour</b></font>

310
00:18:04,790 --> 00:18:06,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to bolster our travel funds.</b></font>

311
00:18:06,340 --> 00:18:09,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wasn't expecting to come upon
such a feast for the eyes.</b></font>

312
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:11,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] It's beautiful.</b></font>

313
00:18:12,470 --> 00:18:14,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] This is
more than enough reason</b></font>

314
00:18:14,130 --> 00:18:16,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to see our quest
through to the end.</b></font>

315
00:18:16,850 --> 00:18:18,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

316
00:18:19,430 --> 00:18:22,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] If we defeat
the Demon King,</b></font>

317
00:18:22,520 --> 00:18:26,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a time will come when anyone
can enjoy this beautiful sight.</b></font>

318
00:18:29,980 --> 00:18:32,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not just anyone could make
this harsh journey.</b></font>

319
00:18:32,860 --> 00:18:35,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But in this era, more people
will see this wonder</b></font>

320
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:37,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than in any era before.</b></font>

321
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:40,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a strange feeling.</b></font>

322
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:45,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] It really is beautiful.</b></font>

323
00:18:45,170 --> 00:18:46,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Yeah.</b></font>

324
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:48,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yet soon enough,</b></font>

325
00:18:48,210 --> 00:18:50,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it will be broken into rubble
by human hands.</b></font>

326
00:18:51,300 --> 00:18:52,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a bit sad,</b></font>

327
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:55,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but no one can stop
the march of time.</b></font>

328
00:18:57,260 --> 00:18:58,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Take it in.</b></font>

329
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:01,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once you have, we'll erect
the barrier and head back.</b></font>

330
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:05,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] A job well done.
Thank you.</b></font>

331
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:07,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here's your reward.</b></font>

332
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:12,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm just relieved we can finally
preserve the vein.</b></font>

333
00:19:12,530 --> 00:19:13,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Preserve?</b></font>

334
00:19:13,690 --> 00:19:16,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, you aren't intending
to mine it later?</b></font>

335
00:19:16,110 --> 00:19:19,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was in my childhood here
that I decided my fate.</b></font>

336
00:19:19,910 --> 00:19:22,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One glimpse
of that beautiful sight</b></font>

337
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:25,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I knew I wanted
to become an adventurer.</b></font>

338
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:29,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now it's safe.</b></font>

339
00:19:29,040 --> 00:19:31,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks for protecting
the wonders of my home.</b></font>

340
00:19:33,050 --> 00:19:34,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course.</b></font>

341
00:19:36,510 --> 00:19:37,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

342
00:19:39,300 --> 00:19:42,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Protecting other people's homes
is an important job, huh?</b></font>

343
00:19:43,770 --> 00:19:45,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes, it is.</b></font>

344
00:19:46,230 --> 00:19:48,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The more I look back on it now,</b></font>

345
00:19:48,560 --> 00:19:50,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the surer I am
that Master Heiter</b></font>

346
00:19:50,980 --> 00:19:52,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>protected my home, too.</b></font>

347
00:19:54,780 --> 00:19:58,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's true that war left
my physical home in ruins.</b></font>

348
00:19:58,740 --> 00:20:03,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even so, because of him,
I have the precious memories.</b></font>

349
00:20:04,750 --> 00:20:06,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern chuckles softly]</b></font>

350
00:20:07,210 --> 00:20:08,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark chuckles softly]</b></font>

351
00:20:10,170 --> 00:20:11,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
Those are what count.</b></font>

352
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:15,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When I told you the story
about me fleeing my home,</b></font>

353
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:18,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you didn't let it impact
your opinion of me</b></font>

354
00:20:18,050 --> 00:20:20,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the slightest.
You continued to believe in me.</b></font>

355
00:20:22,890 --> 00:20:24,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nothing's changed.</b></font>

356
00:20:24,430 --> 00:20:27,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You always encourage me
and push me forward.</b></font>

357
00:20:27,520 --> 00:20:28,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why?</b></font>

358
00:20:31,270 --> 00:20:33,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

359
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:38,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Because that's what
Mistress Frieren would do.</b></font>

360
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:40,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

361
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Stark groans]
-[Fern sighs]</b></font>

362
00:20:58,590 --> 00:21:00,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Mistress Frieren,</b></font>

363
00:21:00,260 --> 00:21:02,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you know the prices here
are astronomical,</b></font>

364
00:21:02,510 --> 00:21:03,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>yet you went shopping?</b></font>

365
00:21:03,970 --> 00:21:06,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A magic item like this
is a rare find.</b></font>

366
00:21:06,520 --> 00:21:10,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just like that, we're back
to barely scraping by.</b></font>

367
00:21:10,060 --> 00:21:11,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern chuckles softly]</b></font>

368
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:13,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I had a feeling
this would happen,</b></font>

369
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:15,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I hid our cut of the reward.</b></font>

370
00:21:15,320 --> 00:21:16,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Seriously?</b></font>

371
00:21:16,900 --> 00:21:18,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You never let me down, Fern.</b></font>

372
00:21:19,650 --> 00:21:22,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And that is why
you are my student.</b></font>

373
00:21:22,410 --> 00:21:23,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern chuckles softly]</b></font>

374
00:21:23,950 --> 00:21:25,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Always a mystery.</b></font>

375
00:21:57,650 --> 00:21:59,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, shall we be off, then?</b></font>

376
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:08,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[LERNEN] This is Edel,
a second-class mage.</b></font>

377
00:22:08,660 --> 00:22:11,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She specializes
in mental magic.</b></font>

378
00:22:11,750 --> 00:22:16,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I asked her to accompany me
so she could reexamine the area.</b></font>

379
00:22:16,380 --> 00:22:18,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She obtained some
new information.</b></font>

380
00:22:18,630 --> 00:22:21,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Information you, for one,
will surely find valuable.</b></font>

381
00:22:22,880 --> 00:22:25,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Denken, your hand...</b></font>

382
00:22:25,510 --> 00:22:27,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll transfer the memories
to you.</b></font>

383
00:22:30,390 --> 00:22:31,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[DENKEN] Go ahead.</b></font>

384
00:22:40,360 --> 00:22:43,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[LERNEN] And with that,
I leave you to your work.</b></font>

385
00:22:44,280 --> 00:22:46,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your duty is straightforward.</b></font>

386
00:22:46,450 --> 00:22:47,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maintain and manage</b></font>

387
00:22:47,990 --> 00:22:50,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the barriers surrounding
the golden land.</b></font>

388
00:22:50,790 --> 00:22:52,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That is your charge.</b></font>

389
00:22:52,250 --> 00:22:55,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You shall do nothing more
and nothing less.</b></font>

390
00:22:56,460 --> 00:22:57,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

391
00:23:01,340 --> 00:23:02,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EDEL] Denken...</b></font>

392
00:23:03,550 --> 00:23:06,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Her grave is just a hole
in the ground.</b></font>

393
00:23:07,590 --> 00:23:09,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[DENKEN] I'm aware.</b></font>

394
00:23:14,020 --> 00:23:16,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EDEL] He intends to die.</b></font>

395
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:19,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yet I feel a touch of envy,</b></font>

396
00:23:20,020 --> 00:23:24,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for never in my wildest dreams
would I defy Mistress Serie.</b></font>

397
00:23:27,610 --> 00:23:29,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[LERNEN] The final
and the strongest</b></font>

398
00:23:29,580 --> 00:23:31,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of the Seven Sages awaits him.</b></font>

399
00:23:32,580 --> 00:23:35,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Macht of the Golden Land.</b></font>

400
00:23:36,750 --> 00:23:39,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The valiant Denken
shall fight to the bitter end</b></font>

401
00:23:39,540 --> 00:23:41,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to save his gleaming home.</b></font>

402
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:48,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fate pulls him like
he's the hero in a fairy tale.</b></font>

